{"page": 4, "segments": [{"index": 0, "text": "Initialization: i=2, A[1:1] has 1 element \u2192 trivially sorted \nMaintenance: inner while shifts elements > key right; inserting\nkey at correct position preserves sorted order\nTermination: i=n+1, A[1:n] is sorted \u2192 algorithm correct", "rects": [[140.68798828125, 90.39146423339844, 477.777587890625, 100.83146667480469], [140.68798828125, 101.33555603027344, 488.82958984375, 111.77555847167969], [140.68798828125, 112.27964782714844, 394.8876037597656, 122.71965026855469], [140.68798828125, 123.22349548339844, 450.1475830078125, 133.6634979248047]], "duration": 19.95, "start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 19.95}, {"index": 1, "text": "Complexity: Best \u0398(n) (already sorted \u2014 while never executes),\nWorst/Average \u0398(n\u00b2), Space O(1) in-place", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 143.38365173339844, 460.2635803222656, 153.8236541748047], [117.64799499511719, 154.32749938964844, 338.69158935546875, 164.7675018310547]], "duration": 8.275, "start_time": 19.95, "end_time": 28.225}, {"index": 2, "text": "Example: A=[5,2,4,6,1,3]. i=2: key=2, shift 5\u21922. i=3: key=4, shift\n5\u21923. i=4: no shift. i=5: key=1, shift all. i=6: key=3, shift 6,5,4\u21923.\nFinal: [1,2,3,4,5,6]", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 174.48765563964844, 482.3675842285156, 184.9276580810547], [117.64799499511719, 185.43150329589844, 498.9455871582031, 195.8715057373047], [117.64799499511719, 196.37559509277344, 228.17160034179688, 206.8155975341797]], "duration": 25.575, "start_time": 28.225, "end_time": 53.8}, {"index": 3, "text": "MERGE(A, p, q, r)", "rects": [[94.60800170898438, 219.70213317871094, 170.956787109375, 228.18463134765625], [117.64799499511719, 261.1740417480469, 193.99679565429688, 269.65655517578125], [135.61199951171875, 605.6220703125, 211.96078491210938, 614.1045532226562]], "duration": 2.025, "start_time": 53.8, "end_time": 55.824999999999996}, {"index": 4, "text": "Steps:", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 241.30357360839844, 150.80760192871094, 251.7435760498047], [117.64799499511719, 542.5516357421875, 150.80760192871094, 552.9916381835938]], "duration": 1.375, "start_time": 55.824999999999996, "end_time": 57.199999999999996}, {"index": 5, "text": "MERGE(A, p, q, r)\nn = q - p + 1\nn = r - q\nlet L[1:n+1] and R[1:n+1] be arrays\nfor i = 1 to n:\n    L[i] = A[p + i - 1]\nfor j = 1 to n:\n    R[j] = A[q + j]\nL[n+1] = \u221e   // sentinel\nR[n+1] = \u221e   // sentinel\ni = 1\nj = 1\nfor k = p to r:\n    if L[i] \u2264 R[j]:\n        A[k] = L[i]\n        i = i + 1\n    else:\n        A[k] = R[j]\n        j = j + 1", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 261.1740417480469, 193.99679565429688, 269.65655517578125], [117.64799499511719, 269.8141784667969, 176.0327911376953, 278.29669189453125], [117.64799499511719, 278.4540710449219, 158.06878662109375, 286.93658447265625], [117.64799499511719, 287.0942077636719, 274.83477783203125, 295.57672119140625], [117.64799499511719, 295.7341003417969, 185.01480102539062, 304.21661376953125], [117.64799499511719, 304.3742370605469, 220.9427947998047, 312.85675048828125], [117.64799499511719, 313.0141296386719, 185.01480102539062, 321.49664306640625], [117.64799499511719, 321.6540222167969, 202.97879028320312, 330.13653564453125], [117.64799499511719, 330.2941589355469, 225.4337921142578, 338.77667236328125], [117.64799499511719, 338.9340515136719, 225.4337921142578, 347.41656494140625], [117.64799499511719, 347.5741882324219, 140.10479736328125, 356.05670166015625], [117.64799499511719, 356.2140808105469, 140.10479736328125, 364.69659423828125], [117.64799499511719, 364.8542175292969, 185.01480102539062, 373.33673095703125], [117.64799499511719, 373.4941101074219, 202.97879028320312, 381.97662353515625], [117.64799499511719, 382.1342468261719, 202.97879028320312, 390.61676025390625], [117.64799499511719, 390.7741394042969, 193.99679565429688, 399.25665283203125], [117.64799499511719, 399.4140319824219, 158.06878662109375, 407.89654541015625], [117.64799499511719, 408.0541687011719, 202.97879028320312, 416.53668212890625], [117.64799499511719, 416.6940612792969, 193.99679565429688, 425.17657470703125]], "duration": 46.5, "start_time": 57.199999999999996, "end_time": 103.69999999999999}, {"index": 6, "text": "Loop invariant: At start of each k iteration, A[p:k-1] contains k-p\nsmallest elements of LR in sorted order; L[i] and R[j] are smallest\nremaining elements of their respective arrays", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 434.8394775390625, 487.8935852050781, 445.2794494628906], [117.64799499511719, 445.7835693359375, 487.8935852050781, 456.2235412597656], [117.64799499511719, 456.7276611328125, 366.32159423828125, 467.1676330566406]], "duration": 14.275, "start_time": 103.69999999999999, "end_time": 117.975}, {"index": 7, "text": "Complexity: \u0398(n) where n = r-p+1", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 476.8875732421875, 294.48358154296875, 487.3275451660156]], "duration": 4.175, "start_time": 117.975, "end_time": 122.14999999999999}, {"index": 8, "text": "Space: \u0398(n) auxiliary for temporary L and R arrays", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 497.0474853515625, 393.95159912109375, 507.4874572753906]], "duration": 4.375, "start_time": 122.14999999999999, "end_time": 126.52499999999999}, {"index": 9, "text": "MERGE-SORT(A, p, r)", "rects": [[94.60800170898438, 520.9501953125, 179.9387969970703, 529.4326782226562], [117.64799499511719, 562.422119140625, 202.97879028320312, 570.9046020507812]], "duration": 2.275, "start_time": 126.52499999999999, "end_time": 128.79999999999998}, {"index": 10, "text": "Steps:", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 241.30357360839844, 150.80760192871094, 251.7435760498047], [117.64799499511719, 542.5516357421875, 150.80760192871094, 552.9916381835938]], "duration": 1.375, "start_time": 128.79999999999998, "end_time": 130.17499999999998}, {"index": 11, "text": "MERGE-SORT(A, p, r)\nif p < r:\n    q = (p+r)/2             // divide\n    MERGE-SORT(A, p, q)        // conquer left\n    MERGE-SORT(A, q+1, r)      // conquer right\n    MERGE(A, p, q, r)          // combine", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 562.422119140625, 202.97879028320312, 570.9046020507812], [117.64799499511719, 571.062255859375, 158.06878662109375, 579.5447387695312], [117.64799499511719, 579.7021484375, 283.8167724609375, 588.1846313476562], [117.64799499511719, 588.342041015625, 324.23577880859375, 596.8245239257812], [117.64799499511719, 596.982177734375, 328.726806640625, 605.4646606445312], [117.64799499511719, 605.6220703125, 301.7807922363281, 614.1045532226562]], "duration": 18.225, "start_time": 130.17499999999998, "end_time": 148.39999999999998}, {"index": 12, "text": "Correctness: induction on n = r-p+1. Base case n=1 (p\u2265r) trivially\nsorted. Inductive step: assume MERGE-SORT correctly sorts left and\nright halves; MERGE produces correct merge of sorted lists.", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 623.7674560546875, 482.3675842285156, 634.2074584960938], [117.64799499511719, 634.7115478515625, 482.3675842285156, 645.1515502929688], [117.64799499511719, 645.6556396484375, 443.6855773925781, 656.0956420898438]], "duration": 17.725, "start_time": 148.39999999999998, "end_time": 166.12499999999997}, {"index": 13, "text": "Complexity: T(n) = 2T(n/2) + \u0398(n) \u2192 \u0398(n lg n). Space: \u0398(n) auxiliary", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 665.8155517578125, 493.4195861816406, 676.2555541992188]], "duration": 8.625, "start_time": 166.12499999999997, "end_time": 174.74999999999997}, {"index": 14, "text": "Example: A=[12,3,7,9,14,6,11,2]. Divide to singletons, merge: [3,12]&\n[7,9]\u2192[3,7,9,12]; [6,14]&[2,11]\u2192[2,6,11,14]; final\nmerge\u2192[2,3,6,7,9,11,12,14]", "rects": [[117.64799499511719, 685.9754638671875, 498.9455871582031, 696.4154663085938], [117.64799499511719, 696.9195556640625, 393.95159912109375, 707.3595581054688], [117.64799499511719, 707.8636474609375, 261.32757568359375, 718.3036499023438]], "duration": 20.825, "start_time": 174.74999999999997, "end_time": 195.57499999999996}, {"index": 15, "text": "Formulas & Equations", "rects": [[94.60800170898438, 730.9034423828125, 205.131591796875, 741.3434448242188]], "duration": 2.075, "start_time": 195.57499999999996, "end_time": 197.64999999999995}], "total_segments": 16, "status": "ready", "audio_url": "/static/sessions/9627eb5d/pages/4/page_audio.mp3", "total_duration": 197.64999999999995}